{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clan fantasy adventures is a turn-based 2D RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game controle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be play only with keyboard and mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A : talk, do actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >direction key : to move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB : open menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z : cancel action (in fight)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Marco, a young boy who wants to become a swordsman and his mage friend Vard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During one of their mission, they will encounter a metamorph of the wolf clan with serious wound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by helping him, they will put themself into a major conflict between several country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the world to gain new allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your allies to learn new techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies in turn-based battles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600380?t=1772352156","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600380?t=1772352156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600380/abb1351353c26ac98e681f0f1c2483fb26cb6d46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772352156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600380/abb1351353c26ac98e681f0f1c2483fb26cb6d46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772352156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descripto